      5 
      <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">تروّغ</span></b>  <i>He</i> (a beast) <i>rolled,</i> or <i>turned himself
over.</i> (JK, IDrd, K.) And <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">تروّغ فِى الطِّينِ</span> <i>He
became befouled,</i> or <i>bedaubed, in the mud.</i> (JK.)

